### ====================================================================
### 2. PUBLIC APIS (No Token Required)
### ====================================================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Dynamic Gallery &mdash; All Paintings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/paintings

### Dynamic Gallery &mdash; Filtered by PENCIL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/paintings?category=PENCIL

### Dynamic Gallery &mdash; Filtered by CHARCOAL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/paintings?category=CHARCOAL

### Products Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products

### Dynamic Price Estimation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/price/estimate?medium=PENCIL&size=A3&faces=2

### Razorpay Webhook (signed; test locally only)
# Localhost cannot receive real Razorpay deliveries. For a local test, replace
# the signature with HMAC-SHA256(raw body, RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET) in hex.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/razorpay
Content-Type: application/json
X-Razorpay-Signature: <HMAC_SHA256_HEX>
X-Razorpay-Event-Id: evt_local_test_1

{
  "event": "payment.captured",
  "payload": {
    "payment": {
      "entity": {
        "id": "pay_REPLACE_ME",
        "order_id": "order_REPLACE_ME",
        "amount": 450000,
        "currency": "INR",
        "status": "captured",
        "method": "card"
      }
    }
  }
}


### ====================================================================
### 3. CUSTOMER APIS (Requires CUSTOMER Token)
### ====================================================================

### Get Current Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Create Portrait Order
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "painting_category": "PENCIL",
  "size": "A3",
  "persons_included": "COUPLE",
  "reference_image_url": "/paintings/PhotoGrid_1580669157513.jpg",
  "delivery_address": "Flat 402, Sunshine Apts, Baner, Pune",
  "customer_notes": "Please focus on realistic eye detail."
}

@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.order_id}}

### List Customer Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Get Specific Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### ====================================================================
### 3b. PAYMENTS (mode is set by the SERVER, not the client)
### ====================================================================
# PAYMENT_PROVIDER=manual (portable default): mock checkout, no money moves;
# an admin confirms with "Confirm Manual Payment" in section 5.
# PAYMENT_PROVIDER=razorpay + PAYMENTS_LIVE=false + rzp_test_... keys:
# Razorpay test mode; test cards/UPI move no real money.
# PAYMENT_PROVIDER=razorpay + PAYMENTS_LIVE=true + rzp_live_... keys:
# real money; requires KYC and a public HTTPS webhook.
# The order must be PLACED. Amount is computed server-side.

### Start Checkout (manual mock or create Razorpay order)
# @name checkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Verify Razorpay Payment (Razorpay mode only, after Checkout.js success)
# Copy razorpay_order_id from the checkout response and the payment id +
# signature from the Checkout.js handler (or Razorpay test dashboard).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "razorpay_order_id": "<RAZORPAY_ORDER_ID>",
  "razorpay_payment_id": "<RAZORPAY_PAYMENT_ID>",
  "razorpay_signature": "<RAZORPAY_SIGNATURE>"
}


### ====================================================================
### 4. ARTIST APIS (Requires ARTIST Token)
### ====================================================================

### Get Artist Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/artist/profile/view
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}

### Update Artist Profile Bio
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/artist/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Specializing in graphite and charcoal realistic portraits with 5 years experience.",
  "experience_years": 5
}

### Check Artist Review Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/artist/profile/review-status
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}

### Upload Portfolio Painting
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/artist/paintings/add
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Evening Reflections",
  "description": "Original charcoal sketch on archival paper",
  "category": "CHARCOAL",
  "image_url": "/paintings/PhotoGrid_1581055303423.jpg"
}

### List Available Verified Artists (Roster)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/artists/verified
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}


### ====================================================================
### 5. ADMIN APIS (Requires ADMIN Token)
### ====================================================================

### View Artist Review Queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/artists/review-queue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Verify / Approve an Artist
# Replace with actual unverified artist UUID from review-queue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/verify-artist/e8d28200-9727-4246-b5a8-b4debd00710c
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### View All Customer Orders (Admin View)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Confirm Manual Payment (PLACED -> CONFIRMED)
# Manual mode only. In Razorpay mode the webhook or /payments/verify confirms
# automatically; this endpoint remains the admin fallback.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Assign Customer Order to a Verified Artist
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "artist_id": "e8d28200-9727-4246-b5a8-b4debd00710c"
}

### Update Order Status to IN_PROGRESS
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Complete Artwork & Auto-Synthesize Comparison Collage
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "final_image_url": "/paintings/PhotoGrid_1581055541054.jpg"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5b. DELIVERY AGENT & COURIER TRANSIT
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### List Active Delivery Agents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/delivery-agents
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin Assigns Delivery Agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/assign-delivery
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delivery_agent_id": "c0a80123-4567-89ab-cdef-0123456789ab"
}

# Re-assigning while the order is already IN_TRANSIT or OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
# changes only the courier and preserves the customer-visible status.

### Admin Updates Logistics / Tracking
# Does not change the order status. Customers see these values in My Orders.
# Tracking buttons are generated for Blue Dart, Delhivery and DTDC only;
# other couriers show the AWB without a fabricated link.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/logistics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courier_partner": "Blue Dart",
  "tracking_number": "BD123456789IN",
  "estimated_delivery_at": "2026-10-25T10:00:00Z",
  "admin_dispatch_notes": "Handle the artwork with care."
}

### Delivery Agent Views Assigned Parcels
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{deliveryToken}}

### Delivery Agent Marks IN_TRANSIT (Dispatched from Studio)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{deliveryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_TRANSIT"
}

### Delivery Agent Marks OUT_FOR_DELIVERY (Courier on Route)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{deliveryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY"
}

### Delivery Agent Marks DELIVERY_FAILED (Exception / Retry Log)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{deliveryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DELIVERY_FAILED",
  "delivery_failure_reason": "Customer premises locked / phone unreachable"
}

### Delivery Agent Confirms Handover (DELIVERED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{deliveryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DELIVERED"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5c. ADMIN QUALITY CONFIRMATION & PUBLIC GALLERY PUBLISH
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Admin Confirms Artwork & Publishes to Public Gallery
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm-gallery
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5d. REFUNDS (Razorpay only)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Refund a Captured Razorpay Payment (full refund)
# The order must have a PAID Razorpay payment. Manual payments return 400.
# Live mode moves real money. Partial refunds are not supported.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ====================================================================
### 6. ROLE VALIDATION CHECKS (EXPECTED 403 FORBIDDEN)
### ====================================================================

### TEST 1: Customer attempting to access Admin Review Queue (Should fail with 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/artists/review-queue
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### TEST 2: Customer attempting to view all platform orders (Should fail with 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### TEST 3: Customer attempting to access Artist Profile (Should fail with 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/artist/profile/view
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### TEST 4: Assigning order to a non-verified artist ID (Should fail with 400/403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "artist_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}
